:"File Size","text_performance.pageSpeedLoadingTime":"Loading Time","text_performance.timeline":"Timeline","text_performance.timelineHeaders":"Headers","text_performance.timelineResponse":"Response","text_performance.timelineDetails":"Details","text_performance.adviceCategoryPerformance":"Performance","text_performance.adviceCategoryBestPractice":"Best Practice","text_performance.adviceCategoryAccessibility":"Accessibility","text_performance.method":"Method","text_performance.fileType":"File Type","text_performance.size":"Size","text_performance.responseHeaders":"Response Headers","text_back":"Back","text_tenweb":"10Web","text_add_website_faq1":"Why do we need your credentials?","text_add_website_answer1":"We need your credentials to install 10Web Manager plugin on your WordPress to connect your site to our unified dashboard from which you can manage literally everything with more ease and convenience. ","text_add_website_faq2":"Why is it secure to share them?","text_add_website_answer2":"10Web is powered by HTTPS protocol which means all your data is encrypted to ensure your privacy and security.","text_add_website_answer21":"10Web Manager plugin is  hosted in the WordPress plugin directory, which means it complies with all the WP standards of security.","text_add_website_answer211":"We do not store your Username and Password.","text_add_website_answer22":"Thousands of users have already trusted us with their info and we have definitely not let them down. ","text_add_website_faq3":"Still not convinced? ","text_add_website_answer3":"It\u2019s fine not to trust us right off the bat. You don\u2019t have to give your credentials. Just change tabs to <a class=\'db-link manually\'>\u201cManually\u201d</a> and follow the instructions. ","text_checkout_coupon_server_error":"This coupon code is invalid or has expired.","text_checkout_coupon_invalid_error":"This coupon code is invalid.","text_checkout_faq_title":"Frequently Asked Questions","text_checkout_faq1":"Why do I need 10WEB?","text_checkout_answer1":"10Web is designed for individuals and businesses that own WordPress websites. We enable you to design and develop your website with no technical skills required. You can subscribe to 10Web Premium bundle to get access to all our premium dashboard, services, plugins and themes, get new released products, updates and premium support for any issue you might have. Or you can choose to use the free account that comes with a unified dashboard and services with certain limitations.","text_checkout_faq2":"Can I try before I buy?","text_checkout_answer2":"Currently, we don\u2019t have a trial, but you can get started with the Starter plan for free, get used to our services and use the free products before upgrading to a premium plan.","text_checkout_faq3":"When will I be billed?","text_checkout_answer3":"If you\u2019re using our Premium Bundle Plan, we automatically bill you at the beginning of each subscription period depending on the plan you\u2019ve chosen during sign-up.","text_checkout_faq4":"Can I buy a single plugin or theme?","text_checkout_answer4":"Yes.We\u2019re aiming to provide a complete set of solutions that our members need for their WordPress websites, but we understand that you might need just one product. If you\u2019re interested in just one plugin or theme, please navigate to the page of that plugin/theme and you\u2019ll be able to purchase just that product. Please note that when purchasing a single product you also get access to our dashboard and services like backup, performance, image optimizer and others at no cost.","text_checkout_faq5":"How can I upgrade?","text_checkout_answer5":"You can upgrade your current plan anytime from your 10Web.io dashboard or by contacting our Customer care team at support@10web.io.","text_checkout_faq6":"What happens when I cancel my acoount?","text_checkout_answer6":"You are free to cancel your membership at any time. Your subscription will be valid until the last day of your billing period, so you can use our services until that time. After that, you will no longer be able to use 10Web services and your access to the dashboard will be blocked. All our plugins and themes are GPL so you can continue using premium plugins and themes even after cancellation.","text_websiteCloneOnItsWay":"Website cloning<br/>in progress\u2026","text_websiteMigrateOnItsWay":"optimized copy of your <br/> website on its way...","text_websiteMigrateZipOnItsWayLine":"Uploading the zip file\u2026","text_websiteInactive":"<span>Website disconnected</span>","text_accountSecurity":"Login info & security","text_all-plugins":"All plugins","text_all-themes":"All themes","text_active-plugins":"Active plugins","text_inactive-plugins":"Inactive plugins","text_update-available":"Available updates","text_plugins-scheduling":"Scheduling","text_plugins-scheduling-history":"History","text_10web-plugins":"10Web","text_upload-plugins":"Upload","text_wordpress-plugins":"WordPress repository","text_featured-plugins":"Featured plugins","text_activeInstalls":"<span>{{activeInstalls}}+</span> active installs","text_activeInstallsText":"active installs","text_author":"Author: <span>{{author}}</span>","text_authorText":"Author","text_lastUpdated":"Last updated: <span>{{lastUpdated}}</span>","text_lastUpdatedText":"Last updated","text_compatible":"<strong>Compatible </strong><span>with WordPress {{compatible}} or higher</span>","text_compatibleThemes":"<strong>Compatible</strong><span> with WordPress {{compatible}}  or higher</span>","text_compatibleWpThemes":"<strong>Compatible</strong><span> with your version of WordPress</span>","text_emailPreferences.changeHeader":"Personalize your inbox!","text_emailPreferences.changeDescription":"Change your preferences and choose the types of emails you want to receive:","text_emailPreferences.newsletters":"Newsletters","text_emailPreferences.salesAndPromotions":"Sales and promotions","text_emailPreferences.membersOnlyEmails":"Members only emails","text_emailPreferences.productUpdates":"Product updates","text_emailPreferences.buttonUnsubscribeFromAll":"Unsubscribe from all the above","text_emailPreferences.buttonSave":"Save preferences","text_emailPreferences.unsubscribedHeader":"We\u2019re sorry to see you go!","text_emailPreferences.unsubscribedDescription":"You have been successfully unsubscribed from 10Web e-mail list.<br/>Please note that by opting out you will no longer receive emails from us.","text_confirmDeactivateAndDeletePlugin.header":"Deactivate and delete plugin","text_confirmDeactivateAndDeletePlugin.message":"Are you sure you want to deactivate and delete all selected plugins?","text_confirmDeactivateAndDeletePlugin.message1":"Are you sure you want to deactivate and delete this plugin?","text_confirmDeactivateAndDeletePlugin.messageNetwork":"Are you sure you want to deactivate and delete all selected plugins? All selected plugins will deactivate and delete for all the websites in this multisite.","text_confirmDeactivateAndDeletePlugin.messageNetwork1":"Are you sure you want to deactivate and delete this plugin? All selected plugins will deactivate and delete for all the websites in this multisite","text_confirmDeactivateAndDeletePlugin.cancelButtonText":"Cancel","text_confirmDeactivateAndDeletePlugin.confirmButtonText":"Deactivate & Delete","text_optimizedOfAvailable":"<span>{{optimized}} images</span> of {{available}} images used","text_reductionInfo":"Reduction up to <span>{{reduction }}%</span>","text_optimizeTypeDescriptionReduction":"{{reductionType}} reduction","text_optimizeTypeDescriptionExif":"Keeps EXIF data","text_optimizeTypeDescriptionFullSize":"Keeps full-sized images","text_optimizeTypeHowItWorks":"<a>How it Works</a>","text_optimizerAutoOptimize":"auto-optimize","text_optimizerAutoOptimizeDesc":"Automatically optimize images upon upload.","text_optimizerAutoOptimizeGall":"Optimize photo gallery","text_optimizerAutoOptimizeGallDesc":"Include Photo Gallery images in optimization list."