e.","text_php_is_restarting":"PHP is restarting.","text_supports_reg_expresions":"Also supports regular expressions","text_https_enabled":"HTTPS is enabled","text_urls_removed":"The URLs has been removed from the cache.","text_url_removed":"The URL has been removed from the cache.","text_urls_hasnt_removed":"The URLs hasn\'t been removed from the cache. Please try again.","text_url_hasnt-removed":"The URL hasn\'t been removed from the cache. Please try again.","text_page_deleted":"Your page was successfully deleted","text_page_added":"Your page was successfully added","text_page_reoptimized":"Your page was successfully reoptimized","text_site_cache_cleared":"Site cache cleared successfully","text_site_ob_cache_cleared":"Site object cache cleared successfully","text_site_cache_enabled":"Site cache enabled successfully","text_site_ob_cache_enabled":"Site object cache enabled successfully","text_site_cache_disabled":"Site cache disabled successfully","text_site_ob_cache_disabled":"Site object cache disabled successfully","text_php_restarted":"PHP restarted successfully","text_ttl_changes":"Site cache TTL changed successfully","text_generate_free_ssl":"Generate free SSL certificate","text_remove_free_ssl":"Remove SSL certificate","text_add_free_ssl":"Add custom SSL certificate","text_speedOptimizer":"Website Booster","text_speedOptimizerFrontEnd":"Main","text_speedOptimizerPages":"Pages","text_speedOptimizerImageOptimizer":"Image Optimizer","text_speedOptimizerCloudflare":"Cloudflare CDN","text_speedOptimizerSettings":"Settings","text_speedOptimizerBackEnd":"Hosting performance","text_speedOptimizerPro":"10Web Booster","text_speedOptimizerGeneralTab":"General","text_speedOptimizerIOTab":"Image optimizer","text_speedOptimizerSettingsTab":"Settings","text_speedOptimizerCustomRulesTab":"Custom rules","text_speedOptimizerTitle":"Optimize all images of your website","text_ioOptimizerTitle":"1-click optimization from Media library","text_ioOptimizerDesc":"Improve image loading & website performance by compressing media library images with a single click.","text_ioOptimizerExtremeTooltip":"This mode will significantly reduce image<br/> quality for maximum compression.","text_ioOptimizerTitleTooltip":"The selected mode will be default for future<br/> optimizations unless you select another<br/> mode before optimizing other images.","text_ioOptimizerImagesAllOptimized":"{{count}} images in media library ({{full}} full-sized) are optimized","text_ioOptimizerNoImages":"{{count}} images in media library ({{full}} full-sized)","text_ioOptimizerImagesReady":"The number of optimized images<br/> in your media library.","text_ioOptimizerAllSet":"You are all set","text_ioOptimizerReady":"You are all set","text_ioOptimizerNoImagesToOptimize":"No Images to optimize","text_ioOptimizerReadyToOptimizeDesc":"The number of images in your media library that<br/> need optimization for faster loading.","text_ioOptimizerImagesCount":"{{count}}<span>images</span>","text_ioOptimizerWebPDesc":"Serve images in WebP format.","text_ioOptimizerWebPDescPic":"This will use <picture> tags for images, may break themes in some cases.","text_speedOptimizerTooltip":"WordPress automatically creates several<br/> sizes of each image you upload to the<br/> media library. Therefore the number of<br/> images in your media library is bigger than<br/> the number of full-sized images uploaded.","text_speedOptimizerDesc":"Reduce image size by up to 40% without compromising the quality.","text_speedOptimizerReady":"Ready for Optimization","text_speedOptimizerNoImagesOptimize":"No Images to Optimize","text_speedOptimizerAutomaticOptimization":"Automatic Optimization","text_speedOptimizerAutomaticOptimizationFree":"Automated optimization <i class=\\"db-icon db-icon-ds-diamond\\"></i>","text_speedOptimizerAutomaticOptimizeDesc":"Automatically optimize images uploaded to the media library.","text_speedOptimizerAutomaticOptimizeDescFree":"Automatically optimize new images uploaded to the 