igher plan to create, migrate or optimize more websites.","text_aiEnableTitle":"Turn any web page into a part of your website","text_aiEnableDesc":"10Web\u2019s AI Builder lets you get the initial layout and style of your website with AI,<br/> edit it with 10Web builder based on Elementor, and add more pages to your websites with minimal effort.","text_aiConvertDesc":"Insert the homepage URL of the website you want<br/>to convert to WordPress, and we will copy the layout,<br/>design elements, and content. You can add the rest<br/>of the pages later on.","text_aiConvertTitle":"Convert non-WordPress<br/>website with AI","text_aiCreateDesc":"Any web page you see on the web can become your<br/> homepage. Insert the URL to recreate its layout and<br/> design elements.","text_aiCreateTitle":"Start creating with AI","text_serverPerformanceBenchmark":"<strong>Measures the speed of:</strong> </br>- 10,000 mathematical functions in PHP </br>- 10,000 string manipulation </br>functions in PHP </br>- 10,000 increments in PHP while </br>and for loops </br>- 10,000 conditional checks in PHP </br>- Establishing a MySQL Connection </br>- Querying MySQL version information </br>- 1,000,000 ENCODE(s) with a random seed","text_phpNeedsToBeUpdated":"10Web will soon upgrade its servers to supercharge your website performance. With the upcoming change, PHP versions older than 7.4 will not be supported.","text_phpNeedsToBeUpdatedTools":"10Web will soon upgrade its servers to supercharge your website performance. With the upcoming change, PHP versions older<br/> than 7.4 will not be supported. Please upgrade your PHP version to the most recent one available.","text_stayConnected":"stay connected","text_removeWebsiteTitle":"Remove Website","text_removeSpeedWebsiteDesc":"Removing a website from 10Web will rollback all optimization<br/> and caching configurations and negatively affect your PageSpeed.","text_aiCreateListDesc":"Find a web page you like? Turn it into a part of your<br/> website. Insert the URL to recreate its layout and design<br/> elements.","text_removeSpeedWebsiteListTitle":"By removing you will revert the following:","text_beforeOptimization":"Before optimization","text_afterOptimization":"After 10Web Booster optimization","text_enableTenWebTheme":"Activate 10Web default theme to get the best experience with the builder.","text_boosterLatestVersionRequired":"<p class=\'text-left\'>Latest version is required</p>","text_boosterLatestVersionRequiredDesc":"<p class=\'text-left\'>Please update the 10Web Booster plugin from<br/> WordPress plugin list.</p>","text_specialOfferHeaderUpgradePlanAnnually":"Additional {{percent}}% <br/>lifetime discount","text_specialOfferHeaderUpgradePlanMonthly":"{{percent}}% lifetime <br class=\'db-new-line-for-mobile\' />discount","text_earlyBirdDiscount":"Early bird discount!","text_specialOfferHeaderUpgradePlan":"Additional 40% <br/>lifetime discount","text_specialOfferDescUpgradePlan":"Limited time offer on all <br/>10Web Booster Pro plans!","text_percentOfferText":"Special pricing, only this <br class=\'db-hide-mobile\'/><span class=\'bold\'>Black Friday!</span>","text_upgradePlanTitleFor40Sale":"Upgrade to 10Web","text_upgradePlanDescFor40Sale":"Explore all 10Web premium features, create, migrate & optimize up to 10 websites","text_cdnHeader":"Cloudflare Enterprise","text_cdnDesc":"Make your website 50% faster & accelerate your business<br/>by enabling Cloudflare Enterprise CDN","text_cdnDescSecondSection":"Test the impact of CDN on your website right now","text_cdnDescription":"Enable Cloudflare Enterprise to improve your website PageSpeed, performance and security.","text_cdnDescriptionFree":"Make your website 50% faster by enabling Cloudflare Enterprise CDN.","text_cdnDescriptionPro":"Enable Cloudflare Enterprise CDN to improve your website PageSpeed performance.","text_cdnBenefitsTitle":"Benefits of Cloudflare Enterprise","text_cdnBenefitsTitleFree":"Why Enable Cloudflare Enterprise CDN?","text_cdnContentFree":"As an official Cloudflare Partner we offer our customers Full Page Caching, faster load time,<br/> a more secure firewall and DDoS, HTTP/3 support, free SSLs, and more.","text_cdnContent":"Enterprise is the highest plan of Cloudflare worth $5000/mo. 10Web partnered with Cloudflare to provide you with all of their<br/> benefits within Booster Pro. Read more about how enterprise compares to free and pro <a class=\'db-link-blue\' target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://www.cloudflare.com/plans/#overview\'>Cloudflare pricing plans.</a>","text_cdnUpgradeOffer":"Available with<br/> 10Web Booster Pro","text_enableCloudflareHeader":"Enable Cloudflare integration","text_enableCloudflareSubHeader":"In case it isn\u2019t enter the original server IP of your website.","text_enableCloudflareSubHeaderCDN":"Please provide your original server IP, and disable<br/> Cloudflare proxy for the <b>{{hostname}}</b>.","text_enableCloudflareContent":"We have detected your IP, please double check that it\u2019s your original server before proceeding.","text_enableCloudflareContentCDN":"Your domain is already pointed to Cloudflare.","text_disableCloudflare":"Disable page cache","text_disableCloudflareDesc":"Disabling page cache will significantly slow down your<br/> website and negatively affect its performance.","text_verifyCloudflareHostnameHeader":"Verify and point your domain to Cloudflare","text_addTxtRecords":"Add the TXT records in your DNS management service","text_configDns":"Configure your DNS using the A records below.<br/> Remove already existing A, AAAA, CNAME records with the given Host/Name.","text_dnsNotification":"If your DNS provider accepts only fully qualified domains, then please use <span class=\'bold\'> {example.com}</span>,<br/> instead of using @.","text_clearCloudflareCache":"Entirely clear Cloudflare cache","text_clearCloudflareCacheDesc":"Clear both static and HTML cache. Pages will be<br/> cached again upon first visit.","text_disableCdn":"Disable CDN","text_disableCdnDesc":"Disabling CDN will significantly slow down your website<br/> and negatively affect its performance.","text_disableBtnDialogText":"disable","text_cdnIntegrationInProgress":"Cloudflare integration in progress","text_cdnIntegrationMessage":"We are enabling Cloudflare Enterprise on your website.<br/> This might take a few minutes.","text_updateBoosterPlugin":"10Web Booster V1.123 Released!","text_updateBoosterPluginDesc":"We have just released a new version of the plugin that accelerates all the processes of the plugin to provide you with a better experience. Please update the version to continue.","text_updateBoosterPluginBtnText":"update the plugin","text_boosterFreeFeaturesUpgrade":"Usually all these benefits that are included in Cloudflare enterprise plan cost $5000/mo,<br/> but you get it at the friction of the cost with 10Web Booster Pro plans.","text_cdnSSLIsMissing":"To get the Cloudflare Enterprise end-to-end encryption it is necessary to have a valid SSL certificate on your<br/> website. Please activate an SSL certificate on your domain to continue.","text_cdnSSLIsMissingHosted":"To get the Cloudflare Enterprise end-to-end encryption it is necessary to have a valid SSL certificate on your<br/> website. Please ","text_domainChangedCdn":"Cloudflare Enterprise can only be enabled on your primary domain. If you haven\u2019t pointed a domain or<br/> haven\u2019t made it primary you will need to ","text_enableCloudflareHeaderAlternate":"Enable Cloudflare Enterprise CDN","text_enableCloudflareDescAlternate":"Improve your website PageSpeed, performance and security further.","text_introducingCloudflareTitle":"Introducing<br/> 10Web Booster x <span class=\'db-with-underline-image\'>Cloudflare Enterprise</span>","text_introducingCloudflareDesc":"10Web Booster has partnered with Cloudflare to deliver<br/> the ultimate WordPress speed solution. <span class=\'mt25\'><b>Supercharge your website with Cloudflare add-on:</b></span>","text_introducingCloudflareTitlePercent":"Introducing 10Web Booster<br/> x Cloudflare Enterprise","text_introducingCloudflareDescPercent":"10Web Booster has partnered with Cloudflare to<br/> deliver the ultimate WordPress speed solution. <span class=\'mt20 db-desc-underline\'><b>Get a 30% lifetime discount on 10Web Booster Pro<br> with Cloudflare:</b></span>","text_buyNowCdnTrial":"Get Cloudflare Enterprise add-on<br/> to improve your website PageSpeed, performance and security.","text_buyNowCdnPlatform":"Get Cloudflare Enterprise add-on for ${{parameterPrice}}/mo<br/> to improve your website PageSpeed, performance and security.","text_verifyDomainStep1Title":"Step 1: Verify domain ownership","text_verifyDomainStep1Feature1":"Go to your DNS provider, which is usually the registrar of your domain","text_verifyDomainStep1Feature2":"Navigate to the DNS management section","text_verifyDomainStep1Feature3":"Add the following TXT records:","text_verifyDomainStep1Feature4":"Save TXT records and verify domain to proceed.","text_verifyDomainStep2Title":"Step 2: Point the domain to Cloudflare","text_verifyDomainStep2Feature1":"Configure your DNS using the A records below.","text_verifyDomainStep2Feature2":"Remove already existing A, AAAA, CNAME records with the given Host/Name.","text_verifyDomainStep2Feature3":"Save A records and proceed to finish Cloudflare setup.","text_verifyDomain":"verify domain","text_cancelProcess":"Cancel process","text_tryForFree":"Try for Free","text_chooseCustomDomain":"Choose Custom Domain","text_tryBoosterForFree":"Try 10Web Booster Pro","text_tryBoosterPro":"Try Booster Pro","text_tryBoosterForFree7Days":"Try 10Web Booster<br/> Pro for 7 days","text_proOptimCdnTile":"Pro optimization with Cloudflare CDN","text_proOptimCdnDesc":"Complete your website optimization","text_proOptimCdnOption1":"<b>30%</b>higher PageSpeed score","text_proOptimCdnOption2":"<b>50%</b>faster load times","text_proOptimCdnOption3":"<b>275</b>caching locations worldwide","text_proOptimCdnOption4":"<b>{{pages}}</b> fully optimized pages of your site","text_proOptimCdnOption4NoWebsite":"Fully optimized pages of your site","text_proOptimCdnOptionLong1":"<b>30%</b> higher PageSpeed score<br/> for your entire website","text_proOptimCdnOptionLong2":"<b>50%</b> reduction in loading times<br/> for all website visitors","text_proOptimCdnOptionLong3":"<b>275</b> caching locations worldwide<br/> for location-based access","text_cdnAgencyLimitation":"CDN is included for 10 websites. <br/>You can get an additional website CDN and 100GB Bandwidth for ${{price}}/mo.","text_cdnAgencyLimitationListing":"For Agency plans CDN is included for 10 websites. Agency plan users can buy additional website CDNs and 100GB of Bandwidth for ${{price}}/mo.","text_cdnAgencyLimitationListing5":"For Agency plans CDN is included for 10 websites. Agency plan users can buy additional website CDNs and 100GB of Bandwidth for $5/mo.","text_cdnAgencyLimitationListing4":"For Agency plans CDN is included for 10 websites. Agency plan users can buy additional website CDNs and 100GB of Bandwidth for $4/mo.","text_createTopic":"create a topic","text_getFreeFastSupportTitle":"Get free and fast support<br/> on WordPress.org","text_image_optimization":"Image optimization","text_unlimited_images":"Unlimited images","text_unlimited_images_desc":"10Web optimizes website images through a number of activities:<br/>- Converting Image Format to WebP<br/>- Container-specific Image Resizing<br/>- Lossy reduction<br/>- Keeping Full-sized images","text_auto-optimization":"Auto-optimization","text_auto-optimization_desc":"Automatically optimize images uploaded to the media library.","text_webp_conversion":"WebP conversion","text_webp_conversion_desc":"Achieve an average of 30% more compression than JPEG and JPEG 2000, without loss of image quality.","text_booster_pro_gallery":"Booster Pro","text_gallery_pagespeed_score":"90+ PageSpeed score","text_gallery_pagespeed_score_desc":"We achieve 90+ PageSpeed through a series of technical actions including:<br/>-CSS & HTML Minification & Compression<br/>- JS Minification and Compression<br/>- Image Lazyload<br/>- Font Swap<br/>- iFrame and Video Lazyload","text_gallery_improved_core_vitals":"Improved Core Web Vitals","text_gallery_improved_core_vitals_desc":"10Web helps you pass Core Web Vitals Assessment by:<br/>- Using Critical CSS<br/>- Preload images<br/>- Optimize font delivery<br/>- Use web workers<br/>- Delay or remove non-critical third-party","text_photo_gallery_pro":"Photo Gallery Pro","text_gallery_album_views":"10 gallery/album views","text_gallery_album_views_desc":"Thumbnails, masonry, mosaic, slideshow, image browser, carousel, blog style, and more.","text_gallery_lightbox_effect":"15 lightbox effects","text_gallery_lightbox_effect_desc":"Enjoy fully customizable lightbox with 15 lightbox transition effects, full width view option and filmstrip.","text_gallery_widgets":"4 gallery widgets","text_gallery_widgets_desc":"Use one of WordPress Standard, Tag Cloud, Dynamic Tags Cloud, Slideshow and Gallery widgets.","text_gallery_role_management":"Role management","text_gallery_role_management_desc":"Choose who can add/edit galleries, images, albums and tags.","text_managed_hosting_back_end_page":"Boost your website performance with<br/> 10Web Managed Hosting","text_getFreeFastSupportSubDesc":"Our support team constantly monitors and resolves topics<br/> within 24 hours to provide users with a smooth<br/> optimization process.","text_getStartWithAiPro":"Get 10Web AI Assistant Pro","text_buyExtraWordsWithAiPro":"Get extra words for AI Assistant","text_getStartWithAiProEarlyBird":"Special early bird offer on AI Assistant","text_getStartWithAiProSubHeader":"Generate more game-changing content in minutes by switching to AI Assistant Pro.","text_getBuyExtraWordsWithAiProSubHeader":"Generate more game-changing content in minutes.","text_getStartWithAiProSubHeaderEarlyBird":"Generate more game-changing content in minutes by switching to AI Assistant Pro.","text_aiAssistantTitle":"AI Assistant","text_aiAssistantWebsites":"Websites","text_aiAssistantWebsitesTooltipInfo":"Connect unlimited websites, use AI Assistant on all of them regardless of the plan you choose.","text_aiAssistantWritingLength":"Writing length","text_aiAssistantWritingLengthTooltipInfo":"The length of text AI Assistant can write based on your input.","text_aiAssistantInputLength":"Input length","text_aiAssistantInputLengthTooltipInfo":"The length of text AI Assistant can take as an input.","text_aiAssistantTwentyTemplates":"18 templates","text_aiAssistantTemplates":"Templates","text_aiAssistantEditor":"Editor","text_aiAssistantAddWebsite":"Add website","text_aiAssistantTwentyTemplatesTooltipInfo":"A selection of prompts for tailored use cases, such as product descriptions, FAQs, outlines, advertising copy, etc.","text_aiAssistantXLanguages":"29+ languages ","text_aiAssistantXLanguagesTooltipInfo":"AI Assistant can help you write and modify texts in different languages. Our AI reads content in 29+ languages.","text_aiAssistantEditorDocuments":"Editor/Documents","text_aiAssistantEditorDocumentsTooltipInfo":"Compose texts in a blank document. Format, edit and improve it the way you want to generate long and short-form content.","text_aiAssistantWPFunctionality":"WP plugin (Gutenberg, Classic Editor)","text_aiAssistantOutlines":"Generate outlines","text_aiAssistantOutlinesTooltipInfo":"Generate blog post or article outlines right in Gutenberg editor.","text_aiAssistantIntroductions":"Generate introductions","text_aiAssistantIntroductionsTooltipInfo":"Generate introduction paragraphs right in Gutenberg editor.","text_aiAssistantConclusions":"Generate conclusions","text_aiAssistantConclusionsTooltipInfo":"Generate conclusion paragraphs right in Gutenberg editor.","text_aiAssistantParaphrase":"Paraphrase a text","text_aiAssistantParaphraseTooltipInfo":"Paraphrase and improve your texts right in Gutenberg editor.","text_aiAssistantAddOns":"SEO pack (Yoast SEO)","text_aiAssistantKeyphraseFix":"Keyphrase errors fix","text_aiAssistantKeyphraseFixTooltipInfo":"Automatically fix keyphrases errors in text with AI.","text_aiAssistantDescGeneration":"Meta description generation","text_aiAssistantDescGenerationTooltipInfo":"Generate SEO optimized meta descriptions based on your keyphrase with AI.","text_aiAssistantSeoErrorFix":"SEO analysis errors fix","text_aiAssistantSeoErrorFixTooltipInfo":"Automatically fix SEO analysis errors with AI.","text_aiAssistantReadabilityErrorFix":"Readability errors fix","text_aiAssistantReadabilityErrorFixTooltipInfo":"Automatically fix Readability errors with AI.","text_aiAssistantPassiveVoiceErrorFix":"Passive voice errors fix","text_aiAssistantPassiveVoiceErrorFixTooltipInfo":"Automatically rewrite all the passive voice sentences with AI.","text_aiAssistantTextLengthErrorFix":"Paragraph/Sentence length errors fix","text_aiAssistantTextLengthErrorFixTooltipInfo":"Automatically rewrite paragraphs or sentences according to recommended length.","text_aiAssistantSubheadingErrorFix":"Subheading distribution errors fix","text_aiAssistantSubheadingErrorFixTooltipInfo":"Automatically add subheadings in your text  AI.","text_cancelSubscriptionOneWeekTitle":"Before you go","text_cancelSubscriptionOneWeekMissingFeatures":"Missing desired features","text_cancelSubscriptionOneWeekMissingFeaturesDesc":"We\u2019re constantly working on enhancing our features. In fact, many new<br/> functionalities are on our imminent roadmap. If you\u2019re willing to give us another</br> chance, we offer an option to pause your account, keeping all your details intact.","text_cancelSubscriptionOneWeekSaleTitle":"One more thought","text_cancelSubscriptionOneWeekDesc":"We\u2019re committed to improving and your feedback is invaluable.<br/> Could you share your primary reason for thinking about cancellation?","text_cancelSubscriptionOneWeekFeedbackText":"Feel free to leave a comment to let us know how we can improve.","text_hostingIsAvailableTitle":"10Web Hosting now available!","text_hostingIsAvailableDesc":"Get access to the most powerful automated<br/> hosting for WordPress, powered by Google Cloud. <span class=\'mt25\'><b>Migrate your website to 10Web Hosting to get:</b></span>","text_introAiAssistantTitle":"Introducing 10Web AI Assistant","text_introAiAssistantDesc":"Leverage the power of AI to create SEO optimized<br/> content directly in Gutenberg and Classic Editor<br/> & fix SEO and readability issues in Yoast SEO.","text_testCdn":"Test the CDN","text_orUpgradeNow":"Or Upgrade Now","text_upgradeBlockCdn":"Usually all these benefits that are included in Cloudflare enterprise plan cost $5000/mo,<br/>but you get it at the friction of the cost with 10Web Booster Pro plans.","text_cdnTtfbTitle":"How TTFB and extra fast loading will impact your business?","text_cdnTtfbDesc":"TTFB (Time To First Byte) measures a website\u2019s or web server\u2019s responsiveness and performance.<br/>Lower TTFB means the initial response from the server arrives faster, leading to following improvements:","text_testCdnGenerateFail":"There was an issue while creating the copy of your<br/>homepage for the CDN demo. Please try again.","text_buyExtraWords":"BUY EXTRA WORDS","text_templateProDesc":"This template is available only in Pro plans.","text_downloadAiTitle":"Leverage the power of AI directly<br/>in your WordPress environment","text_downloadAiDesc":"Install 10Web AI assistant plugin to connect your website<br/>to our dashboard and use all the features of AI assistant.","text_grandSlamOfferSectionOneHeader":"Grow your business with<br/> 10Web Booster agency plan","text_grandSlamOfferSectionContent":"We\u2019ve talked with thousands of digital agencies<br/> to create a tailored plan, specifically designed<br/> to help agencies and freelancers like you to scale<br/> their business. Grow your business by reselling<br/> our services.","text_grandSlamOfferSectionUpgradeHeader":"Make your game-changing decision, join 10Web Agency plan","text_grandSlamReduceWorkloadDesc":"Spend your time on what\u2019s the most important: scaling your business.<br/> Say goodbye to hours of manual optimization and let our solution handle it for you.","text_reduceWorkloadOptimizationDesc":"Install 10Web Booster on your clients\u2019 websites and<br/> get it optimized in just 2 minutes.","text_reduceWorkloadCompatabilityDesc":"10Web Booster has been tested with all the top<br/> WordPress services to ensure bigger compatibility.","text_reduceWorkloadSupportDesc":"With our top-notch customer care you will<br/> never need to worry about your clients\u2019 websites.","text_increaseRevenueDesc":"Never worry about hosting downtimes and technical maintenance again.<br/> With 99.9% uptime and elastic scaling, your websites will be up and running at all times,<br/> so you can focus on other tasks.","text_grandSlamOfferImproveRetention":"With the help of our solutions, you and your clients can be sure that your websites<br/> are secure and working uninterrupted.","text_grandSlamOfferMonthlyReports":"Through the 10Web dashboard you can constantly<br/> monitor the performance of your client\u2019s websites<br/> and automatically send them monthly reports.<br/> </br>Your clients will be happy to see how smoothly their<br/> websites are working.","text_grandSlamOfferCdn":"As an official Cloudflare Partner we offer our<br/> customers CDN, Full Page Caching, faster load time,<br/> a more secure firewall and DDoS, HTTP/3 support, free<br/> SSLs, and more. Enabling CDN can get your website:","text_grandSlamGoogleCloudPartner":"Get and give your clients a peace of mind by hosting<br/> their websites on the fastest and the most secure<br/> fully automated hosting for WordPress.","text_grandSlamDdosProtection":"By leveraging Cloudflare\u2019s technology we protect<br/> your website from potential attacks even before<br/> they take place.<br/> </br>DDoS attacks cost millions in business revenue<br/> every year, but you and your clients won\u2019t<br/> have to worry about it.","text_grandSlamAccelerationHeader":"10Web\u2019s \u201cAgency Booster acceleration program\u201c","text_grandSlamAccelerationDesc":"Learn how to grow your Agency by selling website optimization services. Join our special program<br/> and start your journey towards hyper growth.<br/> </br>In this course you will get access to exclusive materials and tools that will help you scale your business on 10Web:","text_grandSlamFeedback":"One of the best things that 10Web offers us is the 90-plus page<br/> speed score. 10Web has incredible reviews. It\u2019s just amazing<br/> how many people love the support and the product of this<br/> company.<br/> </br><span class=\'db-name\'>Kori Ashton</span>","text_referralProgram":"Referral Program","text_pendingReferralTooltip":"Your pending credit will be activated once<br/>the user you referred optimizes their first<br/>website with our service.","text_upgradeToEditDemoTitle":"Upgrade to 10Web Pro to edit your<br/> website and unlock all of 10Web.","text_upgradeToEditDemoDesc":"Use all the features of our AI-powered platform to edit<br/> and host a superfast website, your visitors will love.","text_optimizationWithBoosterAndHosting":"A fully optimized website is critical for your business, and you can\'t get one without a fast hosting.<br/>  Upgrade to 10Web Booster and get a 10Web Hosting add-on to optimize your website frontend and backend now.","text_hyperchargeYourGrowthHeader":"Hypercharge your growth with full website optimization","text_hyperchargeYourGrowthDesc":"Upgrade to Booster Pro and get a 10Web Hosting add-on to fully optimize<br/> both your website frontend and backend.","text_activateBooster":"Activate Booster","text_boosterFree":"10Web Booster Free","text_boosterActivationBannerText":"Go a step further and optimize your entire website, not just images.","text_cdnDemoPageIsReadyTooltip":"We have created a copy of your homepage<br/> on our servers and applied CDN to show<br/> the improvements.<br/> </br>It does not affect the original website and<br/> the copy will be deleted in 1 day.","text_testimonialsBoosterText":"Used number of solutions to improve my website\u2019s speed but they were breaking the site. Now I\u2019ve stumbled upon 10Web Booster and it was amazing","text_testimonialsIOText":"Speed is fantastic and website works smoothly. <br/>I can\u2019t thank you enough for bringing this tool to the market and folks THIS IS FREE.","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeTitle":"Your super fast AI-generated website on 10Web is ready","text_successAfterDemoEcommerceUpgradeTitle":"Your AI-generated Ecommerce website is ready","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeSubhead":"It is time to finalize your website and launch it:","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeSubheadEcommerce":"It is time to finalize your store and launch it:","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBullet1":"Easily edit your pages with drag & drop editor","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBullet2":"Full WordPress backend","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBullet3":"Optimize the SEO of your website","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBullet4":"Connect a custom domain","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBulletEcommerce1":"Edit your store with our drag & drop editor","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBulletEcommerce2":"Manage your inventory and track your orders","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBulletEcommerce3":"Optimize the SEO of your website","text_successAfterDemoUpgradeBulletEcommerce4":"Add your custom domain and launch your store","text_cancelSubscriptionDialogError":"Please select one of the options above","text_passwordProtectionToolsTitle":"Password protection","text_passwordProtectionToolsDesc":"Enable password protection to prevent both visitors and search engines, giving you peace of mind and freedom to work without unexpected viewers. The website is visible from your IP and you can test the speed with <a target=\'_blank\' rel=\'noopener\' href=\'https://gtmetrix.com/\' class=\'db-link-blue\'><span>GTmetrix<span/><a/> and <a target=\'_blank\' rel=\'noopener\' href=\'https://developers.google.com/speed/pagespeed/insights/\' class=\'db-link-blue\'>PageSpeed Insights.<span/><a/>","text_passwordProtectionDisabled":"Password protection disabled successfully","text_passwordProtectionEnabled":"Password protection enabled successfully","text_passwordProtectedText":"The website is visible from your IP and you can test<br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\'/> the speed with <a target=\'_blank\' rel=\'noopener\' href=\'https://gtmetrix.com/\' class=\'db-link-blue\'><span>GTmetrix<span/><a/> and <a target=\'_blank\' rel=\'noopener\' href=\'https://developers.google.com/speed/pagespeed/insights/?url={{websiteUrl}}\' class=\'db-link-blue\'>PageSpeed Insights.<span/><a/><br/> </br>With Password Protection, your site stays hidden from<br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\'/>search engines, giving you peace of mind and freedom<br class=\'ds-hide-mobile\'/> to work without unexpected viewers.","text_paidFeatureDialogSSH":"For security reasons this feature is only available to paid<br/> users. To access SFTP & SSH please make a payment.","text_paidFeatureDialogCloudflare":"For security reasons Cloudflare Enterprise add-on is only available to paid users. To purchase it please upgrade to one of our paid plans first.","text_paidFeatureDialogPassProtection":"For security reasons, this feature is only available to<br/> paid users. To disable password protection please<br/> make a payment.","text_subscriptionVisitorsTooltip":"This number includes your subscription<br/> plan and add-on limits. For every {{visits}} extra<br/> visitors you\u2019ll be charged an extra ${{price}} at<br/> the end of the billing month.","text_subscriptionSSDStorageTooltip":"This number includes your subscription<br/> plan and add-on limits. You\u2019ll be charged<br/> an extra ${{price}} at the end of the billing month<br/> for each extra {{size}} used.","text_subscriptionAddOnLimitsTooltip":"This number includes your subscription<br/> plan and add-on limits.","text_subscriptionBandwidthTooltip":"This number includes your subscription</br> plan and add-on limits. For every {{size}} of</br> extra bandwidth you\u2019ll be charged an extra</br> ${{price}} at the end of the billing month.","text_subscriptionWebsitesTooltip":"Get more websites for:</br> ${{price}}/mo per site</br> {{visits}} visits</br> {{storage}} SSD storage","text_boosterAdvancedSettingsSaveTitle":"Save changes","text_boosterAdvancedSettingsSaveDesc1":"You have made changes on Delay JS/Critical CSS options,<br/> applying these changes will change your current<br/> optimization level accordingly.","text_boosterAdvancedSettingsSaveDesc2":"Applying the changes to Delay JS/Critical CSS options<br/> will change current optimization level.<br/><br/> With test mode active, add <b>?twbooster=1</b> to the URL<br/> to view changes after applying them.","text_boosterAdvancedSettingsSaveDesc3":"Since you\u2019ve enabled the test mode, make sure<br/> to append <b>?twbooster=1</b> to your URL to preview<br/> the changes after applying them.","text_boosterAdvancedSettingsResetTitle":"Reset to default settings","text_boosterAdvancedSettingsResetDesc":"Resetting all advanced settings will apply the extreme<br/> level of optimization to your website, reverting all options<br/> to their default values.","text_deleteAccountTitle":"Delete your account","text_deleteAccountBtn":"Delete Account","text_deleteAccountDesc":"Permanently remove your account and all associated data.","text_deleteAccountInfo1":"You must first remove all active websites associated with your account before you can proceed with account deletion.","text_deleteAccountInfo2":"You must first remove all active websites associated with your account and invited users before you can proceed with account deletion.","text_deleteAccountDialogTitle":"Confirm account deletion","text_deleteAccountDialogSubtitle":"Are you certain you wish to permanently delete your account?","text_deleteAccountDialogDesc":"By proceeding, your user account and your workspace will be deleted without the possibility of recovery. This includes all data such as billing details, payment methods, previous invoices, etc.","text_deleteAccountDialogInfo":"You can\u2019t undo this action. All associated data will be permanently deleted.","text_deleteAccountDialogInputLabel":"To confirm the deletion of your account, please enter your password.","text_accountDeletedTitle":"Your account has been successfully deleted","text_accountDeletedSubtitle":"Your 10Web account and all data associated with it have been successfully deleted.<br/> We\u2019re sad to see you go.","text_accountDeletedInfo":"If you change your mind in the future, you are always welcome back at 10Web.<br/> Just create a new account with us whenever you\u2019re ready.","text_thenWebBuilder":"10Web AI Builder","text_thenWebBuilderEditor":"Drag and Drop editor based<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> on Elementor","text_thenWebBuilderEditorDesc":"Edit newly built websites using the 10Web Editor based on Elementor. Drag and drop widgets and customize them to your own unique style.","text_ecommerceFunctionality":"Ecommerce functionality","text_ecommerceAIAssistant":"Ecommerce AI assistant","text_ecommerceFunctionalityDesc":"AI-powered ecommerce features to accelerate product creation and management from a single intuitive dashboard.","text_thenWebBuilderPremiumTemplates":"Premium templates and widgets","text_thenWebBuilderPremiumTemplatesDesc":"We have enhanced our AI builder with our 50+ premium widgets and templates.","text_thenWebBuilderPremiumConvertAi":"Convert to WordPress with AI","text_thenWebBuilderPremiumConvertAiDesc":"Turn any web page into a template with our AI Builder, all without copying a single line of code.","text_thenWebBuilderGeneration":"Number of website regenerations","text_thenWebBuilderGenerationDesc":"Answer our brief questionnaire, and our AI-powered content generator will create tailored content and images for your business.","text_thenWebBuilderAiAssistant":"Elementor AI assistant","text_thenWebBuilderAiAssistantDesc":"Use our AI assistant to generate content directly in Elementor editor.","text_thenWebBuilderAiAssistantImages":"AI image generation","text_thenWebBuilderAiAssistantImagesDesc":"Generate images for your website using AI in 10Web Builder.","text_thenWebBuilderConvertToAI":"Convert to WordPress with AI","text_thenWebBuilderConvertToAIDesc":"Turn any web page into a template with our AI Builder, all without copying a single line of code.","text_thenWebBuilderCustomDomain":"Free custom domain","text_thenWebBuilderCustomDomainAgency":"1 free custom domain","text_thenWebBuilderCustomDomainDesc":"Get your first custom domain for free. If you choose a more expensive domain, the specified amount will be applied as a discount.","text_thenWebBuilderConnectWP":"Convert a website to WordPress","text_googleCloudHosting":"High performance hosting<br class=\'db-hide-tablet\'/> by Google Cloud","text_googleCloudHostingGuarantee":"99.9% uptime guarantee","text_googleCloudHostingGuaranteeDesc":"Websites hosted on 10Web are up and running 99.9% of the time without a glitch due to Google Cloud.","text_googleCloudHostingVisitors":"Monthly visitors","text_googleCloudHostingVisitorsDesc":"For every 10K extra visitors you\u2019ll be charged an extra $2 at the end of the billing month.<br/> Visits are measured by the total monthly traffic (unique IPs) to your site. These visits are shared across the plan.<br><br>This does not apply to Ultimate plans.","text_googleCloudHostingSSD":"SSD storage","text_googleCloudHostingSSDDesc":"You\u2019ll be charged an extra $2 at the end of the billing month for each extra 5GB used.<br/> All servers use the fastest SSD storage on Google Cloud with built-in redundancy to ensure data integrity.<br><br>This does not apply to Ultimate plans.","text_googleCloudHostingBackups":"Automated daily backups","text_googleCloudHostingBackupsDesc":"Scheduled automatic daily backups\\nenable you to restore a previous\\nversion of your site whenever needed.","text_googleCloudHostingMigration":"Automated 1-click migration","text_googleCloudHostingMigrationDesc":"Move your website to 10Web from any other hosting with just 1 click.","text_googleCloudHostingSSL":"Free SSL certificate","text_googleCloudHostingSSLDesc":"10Web provides you with a free one-click SSL using Let\u2019s Encrypt integration. The SSL certificate will automatically renew once expired, without additional interference.","text_multisiteSupport":"Multisite support","text_multisiteSupportDesc":"Install WordPress multisite and manage all aspects of your WordPress multisite from the 10Web dashboard.","text_googleCloudHostingMalware":"Malware removal program","text_googleCloudHostingMalwareDesc":"Scheduled automatic scanning for security issues in your current versions of WordPress core, themes, plugins and unwanted changes made to your files.","text_googleCloudHostingSSH":"SSH access","text_googleCloudHostingSSHDesc":"SSH access automates your workflow and eliminates risks of man-in-the-middle attacks, keeping data transmissions private.","text_googleCloudHostingPHP":"Up-to-date PHP and MySQL","text_googleCloudHostingPHPDesc":"10Web supports the newest PhP and MySQL versions for a faster database and faster performance.","text_googleCloudHostingData":"Data center locations","text_googleCloudHostingDataDesc":"Choose between our global data center locations for each WordPress install. Your datacenter should be close to your visitors.","text_speedOptimization":"Website speed optimization","text_speedOptimizationFull":"Full website optimization","text_speedOptimizationFullDesc":"Automatically optimize both frontend and backend of your website.","text_speedOptimizationScore":"90+ PageSpeed score","text_speedOptimizationScoreDesc":"We achieve 90+ PageSpeed through a series of technical actions including:<br/>- CSS & HTML Minification & Compression<br/>- JS Minification and Compression<br/>- Image Lazyload<br/>- Font Swap<br/>- iFrame and Video Lazyload","text_speedOptimizationCore":"Improved Core Web Vitals","text_speedOptimizationCoreDesc":"10Web helps you pass Core Web Vitals Assessment by:<br/>- Using Critical CSS<br/>- Preload images<br/>- Optimize font delivery<br/>- Use web workers<br/>- Delay or remove non-critical third-party","text_speedOptimizationTTFB":"Under 100ms TTFB","text_speedOptimizationTTFBDesc":"Reduce the time it takes for your user\'s browser to receive the first batch of your data to under 100ms.","text_speedOptimizationIO":"Image optimization","text_speedOptimizationIODesc":"10Web optimizes website images through a number of activities:<br/>- Converting Image Format to WebP<br/>- Container-specific Image Resizing<br/>- Lossy reduction<br/>- Keeping Full-sized images","text_speedOptimizationSEO":"Search Engine Optimization","text_speedOptimizationSEODesc":"Boost your website\'s SEO rankings with a fast and secure website.","text_speedOptimizationCDN":"Cloudflare Enterprise CDN","text_speedOptimizationWebsitesWithCDN":"Websites with CDN","text_speedOptimizationCDNDesc":"Get website security, performance, and reliability boost thanks to the Cloudflare Enterprise.","text_speedOptimizationFullPageCache":"Full page caching","text_speedOptimizationFullPageCacheDesc":"Get website security, performance, and reliability boost thanks to the Cloudflare Enterprise.","text_speedOptimizationLoad":"10x faster load times","text_speedOptimizationLoadDesc":"275 data centers located across the globe provide visitors with location-based access to your website, while removing latency and improving performance.","text_customerSupport":"Customer support","text_customerSupportEmail":"Email assistance","text_customerSupportEmailDesc":"Submit tickets with any issues you have and our team will get back to you in the shortest time.","text_customerSupportCareChatbox":"Real time chatbox assistance","text_customerSupportCareChatboxDesc":"Our customer support team is at your service 24/7. Reach out to us anytime.","text_customerSupportCareVIP":"VIP priority support","text_customerSupportCareVIPDesc":"Directly connect with our VIP support team through our dedicated Slack channel to solve any issue.","text_customerSupportCareAM":"Dedicated account manager","text_customerSupportCareAMDesc":"Have a dedicated account manager who will help you find solutions to all questions.","text_customerSupportCare":"24/7 customer care","text_customerSupportCareDesc":"Our customer support team is at your service 24/7. Reach out to us anytime.","text_collaboration":"Collaboration","text_collaborationTeam":"User & team management","text_collaborationTeamDesc":"Invite users and give them different permissions to your account and websites.","text_collaborationStaging":"Staging area","text_collaborationStagingDesc":"Stage and test the coming updates on your website\u2019s clone before publishing them.","text_collaborationWP":"WordPress and plugin updates","text_collaborationWPDesc":"Easily update WordPress core through our intuitive dashboard.","text_enterpriseFeatures":"Enterprise features","text_enterpriseFeaturesSOC":"SOC 2 Type II security","text_enterpriseFeaturesSOCTooltip":"Benefit from the highest level of data protection with our SOC 2 Type II certified system.","text_enterpriseFeaturesSLA":"99.9% uptime SLA","text_enterpriseFeaturesSLATooltip":"Our SLA ensures a minimum of 99.9% uptime, meaning consistent accessibility for your site.\\n","text_enterpriseFeaturesInstance":"Dedicated instance","text_enterpriseFeaturesInstanceTooltip":"Enjoy enhanced performance with a dedicated instance, meaning all resources are exclusively for you.","text_enterpriseFeaturesScaling":"Vertical scaling","text_enterpriseFeaturesScalingTooltip":"We can add additional resources to your current servers in order to help increase the capacity.","text_enterpriseFeaturesScalability":"Built-in scalability","text_enterpriseFeaturesScalabilityTooltip":"Easily handle increases in demand with our system\'s built-in scalability, ensuring optimal performance at all times.","text_enterpriseFeaturesMigration":"Free manual migration","text_enterpriseFeaturesMigrationTooltip":"If needed our top engineers will manually migrate your website to 10Web hosting.","text_ecommerceFeatures":"Ecommerce management","text_ecommerceFeatures1":"Conversion-optimized checkout","text_ecommerceFeatures1Desc":"Enhance your store with a top-tier checkout system that enables customers to complete their purchases in a single click.","text_ecommerceFeatures2":"Unlimited products","text_ecommerceFeatures2Desc":"Expand your business by selling an unlimited number of products.","text_ecommerceFeatures3":"Unlimited product variations","text_ecommerceFeatures3Desc":"Expand your business by selling an unlimited number of products variations.","text_ecommerceFeatures4":"Order tracking and management","text_ecommerceFeatures4Desc":"A simple interface to track and manage your orders.","text_ecommerceFeatures5":"Advanced product filter","text_ecommerceFeatures5Desc":"Enhance your website with advanced filters to improve the user experience.","text_ecommerceFeatures6":"Ecommerce analytics","text_ecommerceFeatures6Desc":"Gain insights into your store\'s performance with detailed reports, helping you identify opportunities for optimization.","text_ecommerceFeatures7":"10Web Payments","text_ecommerceFeatures7Desc":"Accept payments instantly with 10Web Payments powered by Stripe.","text_ecommerceFeatures8":"Dispute management","text_ecommerceFeatures8Desc":"Disputed payments (also known as chargebacks) on card transactions.","text_ecommerceFeatures9":"2.9% + 30\xa2 per successful charge for domestic cards","text_ecommerceFeatures9Desc":"A non-refundable fee charged by Stripe for each successful transaction with domestic cards. This fee is not returned even if the order is refunded.","text_ecommerceFeatures10":"0.5% per transaction platform fee","text_ecommerceFeatures10Desc":"A fee applied to each transaction for secure payment processing. This fee is refunded to you in full if the order is canceled or refunded.","text_ecommerceFeaturesToggled":"Ecommerce features","text_ecommerceFeaturesWooCommerce":"Automated Woocommerce integration","text_ecommerceFeaturesWooCommerceDesc":"Easily get the leading WooCommerce plugin installed on your Ecommerce websites.","text_ecommerceFeaturesWooCommerceTemplates":"WooCommerce compatible templates","text_ecommerceFeaturesWooCommerceTemplatesDesc":"Use one of our many WooCommerce compatible templates with our AI builder.","text_ecommerceFeaturesWooCommerceWidgets":"Premium woocommerce widgets","text_ecommerceFeaturesWooCommerceWidgetsDesc":"We have enhanced our AI builder with our 50+ premium widgets and templates.","text_ecommerceFeaturesTemplates":"Premium templates & widgets","text_ecommerceFeaturesTemplatesDesc":"We have enhanced our AI builder with our 50+ premium widgets and templates.","text_ecommerceFeaturesCustomization":"Product page customization with AI","text_ecommerceFeaturesCustomizationDesc":"Simplify your product page customization with the help of AI.","text_ecommerceFeaturesDescription":"Product description generation with AI","text_ecommerceFeaturesDescriptionDesc":"Generate product descriptions with 10Web\'s AI assistant.","text_ecommerceFeaturesCashing":"Full page caching for ecommerce<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> websites","text_ecommerceFeaturesCashingDesc":"Improve server response time and loading by enabling full page caching for static pages to read entirely from the cache.","text_ecommerceFeaturesEasyUse":"Easy to use dashboard for managing<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> products","text_ecommerceFeaturesEasyUseDesc":"Create and manage all your products directly from intuitive 10Web dashboard.","text_ecommerceFeaturesTracking":"Inventory & order tracking","text_ecommerceFeaturesTrackingDesc":"A simple interface to manage and track your inventory.","text_agencyFeatures":"Agency features","text_agencyFeaturesProcessor":"Processor","text_agencyFeaturesRAM":"RAM","text_agencyWebsitesWithPremiumFeatures":"Websites with all premium features","text_agencyWebsitesWithPremiumFeaturesDesc":"Enhance your client\'s online presence with advanced customization, robust security, high-speed performance, and more. Deliver the ultimate digital experience and meet your client\'s unique needs with our premium tools.","text_agencyFeaturesManage":"Manage all your client\'s websites<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\'/> in the same interface","text_agencyFeaturesManageDesc":"Streamline your workflow with our powerful interface. Easily manage all your client\'s websites in one place, handle updates, monitor performance, and make edits seamlessly.","text_agencyFeaturesSeparate":"Separate workspace for each of<br class=\'db-hide-mobile\' /> your clients","text_agencyFeaturesSeparateDesc":"Sort all of your clients\u2019 websites into different workspaces. Separate users, accesses and collaboration tools, while still giving you the ease of access through one intuitive dashboard.","text_agencyFeaturesMigration":"Unlimited 1-click migrations","text_agencyFeaturesMigrationDesc":"Move your website to 10Web from any other hosting with just 1 click.","text_agencyFeaturesWhiteLabel":"White label","text_agencyFeaturesWhiteLabelDesc":"Do you prefer to resell our services without showing it as a third-party solution? Simply turn-on white label functionality through settings.","text_agencyFeaturesMultisite":"Multisite support","text_agencyFeaturesMultisiteDesc":"Install WordPress multisite and manage all aspects of your WordPress multisite from the 10Web dashboard.","text_agencyFeaturesTeam":"User and team management","text_agencyFeaturesTeamDesc":"Invite users and give them different permissions to your account and websites.","text_agencyFeaturesCare":"Customer care","text_agencyFeaturesCareDesc":"Directly connect with our VIP support team through our dedicated Slack channel to solve any issue.","text_agencyFeaturesAutomatedWP":"Automated WordPress and plugin updates","text_agencyFeaturesAutomatedWPDesc":"Automated WordPress and plugin updates","text_agencyBuyAdditional":"Buy additional websites","text_agencyBuyAdditionalTooltipBody":"Get more websites<br/><b>+ 20K</b> Visits</br><b>+ 5GB</b> SSD Storage<br/><b>3</b> website generations","text_agencyBuyAdditionalCDN":"Buy additional CDN Add-on","text_agencyBuyAdditionalCDNTooltipBody":"Get website security, performance,<br/> and reliability boost thanks to the Cloudflare Enterprise. Get a 100GB CDN bandwidth for each additional purchase.","text_enterpriseUltimateTextDesktop":"Get in touch with our<br class=\'ds-show-tablet\' /> team of<br class=\'ds-show-desktop\' /> experts for<br class=\'ds-show-tablet\' /> a dedicated plan<br class=\'ds-show-desktop\' /> tailored<br class=\'ds-show-tablet\' /> for your needs","text_dedicatedHostingTextDesktop":"Get in touch with our<br class=\'ds-show-tablet\' /> team of<br class=\'ds-show-desktop\' /> experts for<br class=\'ds-show-tablet\' /> a dedicated hosting<br class=\'ds-show-desktop\' /> plan tailored for your needs","text_agencyUltimateTextMobile":"Customized<br/> based on<br/> requirements","text_ecommerceEnterpriseFeatures":"Enterprise features","text_ecommerceSecurity":"Enterprise level security","text_ecommerceSecurityDesc":"Get top-notch security measures for your website, including continuous monitoring and stringent firewalls, to ward off cyber threats.","text_ecommerceInstance":"Dedicated instance","text_ecommerceInstanceDesc":"Get your own server instance for faster load times and optimal reliability. Benefit from enhanced performance and customization.","text_ecommerceScaling":"Vertical scaling","text_ecommerceScalingDesc":"We can add additional resources to your current servers in order to help increase the capacity.","text_ecommerceMigration":"Free manual migration","text_ecommerceMigrationDesc":"If needed our top engineers will manually migrate your website to 10Web hosting.","text_ecommerceAdditionalRAM":"Additional PHP workers and RAM","text_ecommerceAdditionalRAMDesc":"Improve your site\'s speed and handling of concurrent requests with extra PHP workers. Extra RAM ensures top performance even for demanding applications.","text_dedicatedHostingPlanTooltip":"Best for high-traffic websites, e-commerce platforms, and resource-heavy sites","text_ecommerceRegenerationTooltipText":"You can increase the plan limits by talking<br/> to your dedicated account manager.","text_ecommerce.title":"Ecommerce","text_ecommerce.orders":"Orders","text_ecommerce.products":"Products","text_ecommerce.customers":"Customers","text_ecommerce.paymentMethods":"Payment methods","text_ecommerce.settings":"Settings","text_ecommerce.analytics":"Analytics","text_ecommerce.marketing":"Marketing","text_ecommerce.payment":"Payment","text_ecommerce.shipping":"Shipping","text_ecommerce.tax":"Tax","text_ecommerce.navigation":"Navigation","text_ecommerce.overview":"Overview","text_ecommerce.payments":"Payments methods","text_ecommerce.transactions":"Transactions","text_ecommerce.payouts":"Payouts","text_ecommerce.emails":"Emails","text_professionalTitle":"Request a developer","text_ecommerce.enableTitle":"The complete toolkit to manage an ecommerce website","text_ecommerce.enableDesc":"Harness the power of 10Web\u2019s AI to create your products, monitor analytics, and manage their entire<br/> lifecycle - from the initial add-to-cart phase through to delivery - all within a single, user-friendly interface.","text_ecommercePremiumWidgets":"Top-tier, customizable widgets and templates specifically<br/> designed to enhance your ecommerce website experience.","text_ecommerceProductPages":"Leverage our AI assistant to create engaging product titles and<br/> descriptions, all aimed at increasing your ecommerce website\u2019s sales.","text_ecommerceDashboard":"An intuitive dashboard for efficient handling and management of your<br/> ecommerce products, providing total control in a few simple clicks.","text_enableEcommerceFeaturesDesc":"Ecommerce features are exclusively available for our<br/> Ecommerce plan users. Upgrade now to make the most<br/> of your online business with our enhanced features.","text_enableEcommerceFeaturesNotAvailableDesc":"Ecommerce features are not available in your plan.<br/> Notify your workspace owner to upgrade<br/> the account to get access.","text_productsAddProductBtn":"Add New Product","text_productsDiscardBtn":"Discard","text_addProductShortDesc":"The short description will</br> appear next to your product.","text_addProductLongDesc":"The long description will</br> appear below your product.","text_addProductAttributesDesc":"Does your product come in different options, </br>like size, color or material? Add them here.\\n","text_addProductTemplateDesc":"A product page template is a pre-designed layout that ensures each product page has a consistent look and feel, matching your store\'s overall design.\\n","text_productsNoMatch":"Does not match any results","text_productsNoProduct":"You don\u2019t have any products.","text_customersNoCustomer":"You don\u2019t have any customers.","text_ordersNoOrder":"You don\u2019t have any orders.","text_customerNoOrder":"Customer does not have any orders.","text_productsStockAmount":"You can add and change the stock amount manually or add quantity to track it </br>automatically.","text_productsPromoteSingle":"Choose a product to promote on the single</br> product page.","text_productsPromoteCart":"Choose a product to promote in the cart.","text_addProductsEditVariants":"Edit variations","text_addProductsViewVariantsDesc":" Edit your variants\u2019 availability, updates the price, or hide the options you don\u2019t want to show.","text_create":"Create","text_professionalPlanUpgradeDesc":"This feature is available exclusively to 10Web Professional plan users.<br/> Upgrade now to get access to 10Web\u2019s developers.","text_professionalPlanPayNowDesc":"This feature is available exclusively to our paid users.<br/> Upgrade now to get access to 10Web\u2019s developers.","text_professionalPlanLockedFeatureDesc":"This feature is only available to paid plans.<br/>To get access to 10Web\u2019s developers please make a payment.","text_professionalPlanRequestSuccessText":"Our team will review your requirements and be in touch<br class=\'small-size\'/> via email to provide further assistance. We look forward<br/> to working with you to achieve your website goals.","text_switchToAnnualSuccessDesc":"Starting from {{date}} you will be charged by annual payments of ${{price}}.","text_welcomeBackDesc":"To get you started, we\u2019re offering 7 more days for free! Your next payment is scheduled for {{date}}. Dive in and make the most of it!","text_disabledPaypalTooltip":"Unfortunately this promo code is only<br/> available with a Credit Card payment.","text_invalidPaypalCouponCodeError":"Unfortunately this promo code is not available with a Paypal payment, please change to Credit Card","text_manualMigrationDialogTitle":"Migrate to 10Web hosting with","text_manualMigrationDialogTitleAccent":"Migration Assistant","text_manualMigrationDialogSubtitle":"Migrate your website from a backup zip file.","text_manualMigrationDialogWarning":"Please follow these steps to receive an optimized copy of your website within a few hours.","text_cdnStatus":"Cloudflare Enterprise can only be </br>enabled on your primary domain.","text_enableEcommerceFeatures":"Enable Ecommerce Features","text_pauseMyAccount":"Pause My Account","text_proceedToCancel":"Proceed to Cancel","text_enableEcommerceFeatures\'":"Enable Ecommerce Features","text_ecommerceSettingsTitle":"Store settings","text_ecommerceWeightUnit":"Weight unit","text_ecommerceDimensionsUnit":"Dimensions unit","text_ecommerceBusinessRegion":"Business region","text_ecommerceCurrency":"Currency","text_requestDeveloperHeader":"Let <span class=\'db-gradient\'>10Web\u2019s professionals</span> build your ideal website, affordably","text_requestDeveloperOneFee":"One fee for a professional website","text_requestDeveloperOneFeeDesc":"Pay a one time fee to get your amazing<br/> website. Get a 10Web hosting for one<br/> year for free.","text_requestDeveloperExcellence":"Excellence and expertise","text_requestDeveloperExcellenceDesc":"Our expert team delivers custom websites<br/> optimized for desktop and mobile, making<br/> your business standout on every device.","text_requestDeveloperHowItWorksTitle":"Submit your list of requirements and share your ideas","text_requestDeveloperHowItWorksDesc":"Crafting your ideal website begins with understanding your vision. Submit your list of requirements and share<br/> your ideas with us. This ensures that every design element aligns with your goals, creating a digital platform<br/> that truly represents your brand.","text_requestDeveloperHowItWorksTitle1":"Expert web development","text_requestDeveloperHowItWorksDesc1":"Once we\u2019ve captured the essence of your vision, our skilled developers embark on the journey of bringing<br/> it to life. Using cutting-edge tools and techniques, we transform your ideas into a functional, user-friendly,<br/> and visually stunning website.","text_requestDeveloperHowItWorksTitle2":"Continuous maintenance and support","text_requestDeveloperHowItWorksDesc2":"The journey doesn\u2019t end once your site goes live. We\u2019re committed to ensuring its smooth operation and relevance.<br/> Get our dedicated maintenance services to guarantee that it continues to meet your evolving business needs.","text_blkOfferFreePlanTitle":"Get <span class=\'with-gradient\'>50% off</span><br/> on the 10Web Platform!","text_blkOfferFreePlanDesc":"Try 10Web Pro for free and get all the<br/> premium features at half the price for<br/> the first payment.","text_blkOffer1wfExpiredTitle":"Renew your subscription<br/> with a <span class=\'with-gradient\'>50% discount!</span>","text_blkOffer1wfPaidExpiredDesc":"Build, host, and optimize websites with AI<br/> at half the price for the first payment.","text_blkOfferPaidTitle":"Upgrade to a higher plan<br/> with a <span class=\'with-gradient\'>50% discount!</span>","text_blkOfferPricingEmptyColumnTitle":"Exclusive<br class=\'ds-hide-tablet\'/> <span class=\'with-gradient\'>50% discount,</span><br class=\'ds-hide-tablet ds-show-mobile\'/> only this<br class=\'ds-hide-tablet\'/> Black Friday","text_blkOfferPricingHeaderTitle":"Black Friday Exclusive: <span class=\'with-gradient\'>50% off the 10Web Platform</span>","text_blkOfferPricingHeaderDesc":"Try 10Web Pro for free and get all the premium features at half the price<br class=\'ds-hide-desktop\'/> for the first payment.","text_blkOfferPricingEmptyColumnTitleForPaid":"Upgrade to a higher plan with a 50% discount: <span class=\'with-gradient\'>Exclusive Black Friday Deal</span>","text_blkOfferPricingEmptyColumnDescForPaid":"Build, host, and optimize websites with AI at half the price for the first payment.","text_menusNoMenus":"You don\u2019t have any menu yet.","text_menusAddMenu":"Add new menu","menu_exists":"This menu name already exists. Please input a different name.","text_submitAndCancel":"Submit & Cancel","text_continueToCancel":"Continue to Cancel","text_addDomainToWebsiteTitle":"Add domain to your website","text_addDomainToWebsiteDesc":"Select a domain, you want to point to your website.","text_addDomainToWebsiteDescEmpty":"You don\u2019t have a registered domain yet","text_addDomainToWebsiteGetDomain":"Get a new domain","text_pointedDomainsTitle":"Pointed domains","text_pointedDomainsDesc":"Point your other domains to 10Web hosting and ensure that the DNS records<br/> for these domains are configured accurately.","text_primaryDomainTooltip":"The primary domain is the main address for your site, the one you want visitors to use to access your website.","text_successfullyCanceledDomainTitle":"Your subscription was successfully cancelled","text_successfullyCanceledDomainDesc":"Thank you for your feedback and using 10Web\u2019s services.","text_successfullyCanceledDomainNotice":"Your domain subscriptions are still active.","text_gotIt":"Got it","text_getNewDomain":"Get a new domain","text_domainsPortfolio":"Domains portfolio","text_findDomain":"Secure your online presence","text_registeringDomain":"Find a perfect domain for your website","text_registeringDomainFree":"Find and claim your perfect domain up to $30 for Free","text_findDesiredDomain":"Enter domain name or keywords","text_typeDesiredDomain":"Type the domain you want  ","text_getIt":"Get It","text_forFirstYear":"For the first year","text_forFirstYearMultiYear":"For the first year","text_domainIsAlreadyTaken":"This domain is unavailable","text_domainTotallyFree":"Totally free with your plan for the first year","text_domainTotallyFreeNotLoggedIn":"With all 10Web platform plans for the first year","text_yearlyPrice":"Yearly price","text_yearlyPriceTooltip":"During the next years you will be charged at the corresponding renewal rate, which is currently at {{price}}/year.","text_forFirstYearTooltip":"Your domain will renew at the<br> regular rate of {{price}} per year.","text_forFirstYearMultiYearTooltip":"Your domain will renew at the<br> regular rate of {{price}} per year. <br><br> Minimum {{period}} year registration","text_domainTotallyFreeNotLoggedInTooltip":"Your domain will renew at the<br> regular rate of {{price}} per year.","text_domainTotallyFreeTooltip":"Your domain will renew at the<br> regular rate of {{price}} per year.","text_subDomainDomainsTooltip":"Your site is accessible at this address by default.","text_manageDnsTooltip":"Domain currently uses custom nameservers. In order for the DNS records to have an impact on your website, it is important to ensure that the domain is using 10Web nameservers.","text_toggleAutoRenewTitle":"{{status}} auto-renewal","text_disableAutoRenewDesc":"Turning off auto-renewal poses a risk of losing your domain if you fail to renew it<br> by the expiration date.","text_enableAutoRenewDesc":"Turning on auto-renewal you agree to be automatically charged each year<br> for the price of your domain.","text_extendRenewTitle":"{{method}} domain","text_extendDesc":"This action will extend the billing date for the domain by the chosen renewal length.","text_renewDesc":"This action will extend the billing date for the domain by the chosen renewal length.","text_domainAddedToYourSiteHeader":"Domain added to your site","text_domainAddedToYourSiteDesc":"To manage your DNS records, click the manage DNS from the domains list.","text_domainAddedToYourSiteNotifDesc":"The DNS configuration is set up. It may take up to 24 hours for it to be resolved and</br> activated. Please wait and check the status again later.","text_customDomainAddedToYourSiteDesc":"Replace the default nameservers at your domain registrar with 10Web nameservers to point domain. It can take up to 24 hours to be resolved and activated.","text_customDomainAddDNSRecordsDesc":"Add DNS records to your domain registrar using the IPv4 address provided below.","text_domainDetailsTenWebNSHeader":"Domain currently uses 10Web nameservers","text_domainDetailsTenWebNSDesc":"To manage your DNS records, click the manage DNS from the domains list.","text_domainDetailsCustomNSHeader":"Domain currently uses custom nameservers","text_domainDetailsCustomNSDesc":"To manage your DNS records, navigate to the dashboard of your DNS provider.","text_domainDetailsCustomNSNotice":"You have the option to switch custom nameservers to 10Web nameservers<br/> within the manage nameservers section.","text_domainDetailsCustomNSNCustomDomainNotice":"To point your domain with 10Web nameservers, replace the default nameservers<br/> at your domain registrar with 10Web nameservers.","text_domainNotPointedIsTenWebDomain":"Point domain","text_domainNotPointedIsTenWebDomainDesc":"The domain currently uses 10Web nameservers.<br/> To manage your DNS records, click the manage DNS from the domains list.","text_domainNotPointedIsTenWebDomainAndNotNS":"Your domain currently uses custom nameservers.","text_domainNotPointedIsNotTenWebDomainAndNS":"Your domain currently uses 10Web nameservers, but the DNS records is not pointing to 10Web hosting.","text_domainNotPointedDNSNotice":"DNS records can take up to 24 hours to be resolved. Please ensure there are no mistakes in the DNS configuration and check again later.","text_domainNotPointedTenWebNS":"To point the domain, update the DNS records through the manage DNS with the following:","text_domainNotPointedCustomNS":"To point the domain, switch the custom nameservers to 10Web nameservers from the manage nameservers. Alternatively, you can add the following records to your DNS provider:","text_domainNotPointedZoneIssues":"Add DNS records to your domain registrar using the IPv4 address provided below.","text_domainNotPointedNotTenWebDomainDesc":"Replace the default nameservers at your domain registrar with 10Web nameservers.","text_domainNotPointedNotTenWebDomainNotice":"<b>Domain isn\u2019t pointed yet.</b> DNS records can take up to 24 hours to be resolved. Please ensure there are no mistakes in the DNS configuration and check again later.","text_domainNotPointedNotTenWebDomainInfo":"Alternatively, you can add DNS records to your registrar using an IPv4 address provided below:","text_renewNow":"Renew Now","text_renewCost":"Renewal cost","text_renewsOn":"Renews on","text_expiresOn":"Expires on","text_linkedWebsite":"Linked website","text_noLinkedWebsite":"There is no 10Web website linked to this domain","text_domainPrivacy":"Domain Privacy is","text_address":"Address","text_contactInfo":"Contact info","text_contactInfoDesc":"This info is used for all contact types:<br> registrant, administrative, technical.","text_editContactInfo":"Edit contact information","text_useForAll":"Use for all contact types","text_toggleRenew":"Turn {{value}} auto-renewal","text_toggleRenewExpired":"Renew subscription","text_domainPrivacyBlocked":"The domain privacy option is not available for this domain.","text_domainPrivacyCanNotSwitch":"Domain privacy cannot be switched off for this domain.","text_domainPrivacyDisable":"If you disable Domain Privacy, your contact information<br> will be visible in the public WHOIS directory.","text_domainPrivacyEnable":"If you enable Domain Privacy, your contact<br> information will be kept private and won\u2019t<br> be visible in the public WHOIS directory.","text_approvalNeeded":"Approval needed","text_approvalMessage":"Approval is required to update contact information. Please review and confirm the changes from the email sent to {{email}}.","text_approvalSubMessage":"The contact info will be updated upon your approval.","text_approvalEmailMessage":"To change the email, approval is needed from both the current and new owners. Kindly review and confirm the changes through the emails sent to both the current and new email addresses. The domain transfer will only proceed upon receiving approval from both emails.","text_approvalWarn":"Email verification might be necessary if the new owner\u2019s email hasn\u2019t been verified.<br> In this case they will receive an additional email for the verification process.","text_removeZoneWarn":"Your site will no longer be accessible through <strong>{{domainName}}</strong>.<br> It will still be accessible through your other domains.","text_emailVerification":"Email verification is required","text_emailVerificationMessage":"To activate your domain, verify the email sent from donotreply@secureserver.net <br> to your account email.","text_domainPurchasedMessage":"Domain is successfully registered and will be automatically pointed to your website.","text_domainPurchasedMessageNeedVerification":"<strong>Email verification is required!</strong> To activate your purchased domain, you should verify the email sent from donotreply@secureserver.net","text_domainPurchasedHeader":"Congratulations, the {{domainName}} is now yours!","text_domainPurchasedNotificationMessage":"After completing the verification, the domain will be pointed to your website.","text_extend":"Extend now","text_domainInProgress":"Domain registration is in progress","text_domainInProgressMess":"Domain activation may take up to 10 minutes. Please wait and check the status again later.<br> If it\u2019s taking too long, please contact our <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://10web.io/contact-us/\' class=\'ds-link unset-size\'>Customer care team</a> for help","text_myDomainPortfolio":"My domains portfolio","text_NSTooltipText":"Nameservers link a domain to IP addresses in a user-friendly manner for directing internet traffic. This configuration determines where you edit your DNS.","text_noPermissionTitle":"No permission","text_noPermissionDescription":"This action is not available for your role. Please contact<br/>the workspace owner or administrator for assistance.","text_convertAISignUpPopUpDesc":"Sign up and insert a URL to recreate a website on 10Web.","text_businessNameGeneratorSignUpPopUpDesc":"Create your account to access your AI-generated website and start customizing:","text_migrateAISignUpPopUpDesc":"Create your account to migrate your website to 10Web","text_convertAISignUpPopUpTitle":"Convert a non-WordPress site to WordPress with AI","text_businessNameGeneratorSignUpPopUpTitle":"Your brand is ready to launch!","text_builder2SignUpPopUpDesc":"Create your account to generate a fully customized<br/>website with tailored content and images.","text_builder2SignUpPopUpTitle":"Create a new<br/>website with AI","text_showBothTLSText1":"Get an exclusive deal for over 20 websites or<br/> high traffic/resource-heavy websites.","text_dedicatedTLSText1":"Get a special offer for high traffic or<br/> resource-heavy e-commerce websites","text_agencyTLSText1":"Get an exclusive deal for over 20 websites","text_dedicatedTLSText2":"Get personalized, continuous support for<br/> unmatched reliability and performance of<br/> your e-commerce website","text_showBothTLSText2":"Get personalized, continuous support from our customer success team","text_upgradeWithDomain":"Get 7 days of 10Web Pro plans","text_freeDomainTitle":"Get your ideal <span class=\'with-gradient\'>domain for Free</span>","text_freeDomainDesc":"Now you can choose and get a free custom domain for up to $30 with all 10Web Pro Plans.","text_freeDomainDescPaid":"Choose and get a free custom domain for up to $30 with your 10Web subscription.","text_chooseYourDomain":"Choose Your Domain","text_getFreeCustomDomain":"Get Free Custom Domain","text_domainOfferTitle":"Get your custom<br/>domain for Free","text_domainOfferProDesc":"Choose and get a free domain for<br/>up to $30 with your 10Web subscription.","text_domainOfferFreeDesc":"Choose and get a free domain<br/>for up to $30 with all 10Web Pro Plans.","text_select":"Select","text_agencyOfferTitle":"<span>Exclusive Deal:</span> Get an exclusive deal for 20+ websites or high traffic/resource-heavy websites","text_websiteCustomizerNotification":"This is not the final website, but a mockup to preview its look and feel.","text_agencyTLSText2":"Get personalized, continuous support for<br/> easy scaling and management of your sites","text_payengineOnboardingSubmittedTitle":"Successfully submitted","text_payengineOnboardingSubmittedDescription":"Your payment is currently pending and may take up to 24 hours to process.<br/>You will be notified via email once the process is complete.","text_payengineTaxCalculationActivatedTitle":"Successfully activated tax calculation","text_payengineTaxCalculationActivatedDescription":"You can start charging tax on your products by either adding rates manually<br/>or setting up an automated tax.","text_payengineTestModeEnabledTitle":"Successfully activated test mode","text_payengineTestModeEnabledDescription":"You start processing test orders and go through the checkout experience.<br/>For more info on how to make test payments, check the knowledgebase.","text_payengineEnablePaymentsTitle":"{{mode}} 10Web Payments","text_payengineEnablePaymentsDescription":"This will {{mode}} 10Web Payments from your website checkout page.","text_payengineSwitchModeTitle":"Switching to {{mode}}","text_payengineSwitchModeLiveDescription":"You are about to switch to live 10Web Payments.<br/> Real financial transactions will occur.","text_payengineSwitchModeTestDescription":"You are about to switch to test mode. This means no real<br/> financial transactions will take place.","text_outlineGenerationFinalizeBottomDesc":"More than <span class=\'db-blue\'>1 million</span> successfully<br/> generated websites","text_questionTourStartTitle":"Take our quick tour to learn how to customize<br/> and generate your future website.","text_questionTourStepOneTitle":"Customize your website sections","text_questionTourStepOneDesc":"A section description acts as a prompt for the AI to<br/> build the corresponding section.<br/> </br>  - Modify any section by editing the prompt </br>- Describe if you want images, buttons or other info </br>- Ensure titles reflect descriptions </br>- Add, reorder, or remove sections easily","text_questionTourStepTwoTitle":"Style your future website","text_questionTourStepTwoDesc":"Play with fonts, colors, and styles to craft the<br/> look of your future website.<br/> </br>Instantly preview it on a demo example.","text_questionTourStepThreeTitle":"Generate your fully customized website","text_questionTourStepThreeDesc":"Generate your personalized website with tailored<br/> content and images, ready for editing with our drag<br/> & drop editor.","text_backup_schedule_dialog_title":"Backup scheduling","text_backup_schedule_dialog_desc":"Set the frequency and start time for automatic backups.","text_backup_zip_download_notice_old":"Preparing the ZIP file may take some time. We will email you the download link once it is ready.","text_backup_zip_download_notice":"Please note that the link will be available for 12 hours.","text_backup_zip_download_desc":"Preparing the ZIP file may take some time. We will email you the download link once it\'s ready.<br/> You can also find the link on the dashboard.","text_backup_restore_desc":"Restoration time may vary depending on the size of the backup. You will be notified via email<br/> when the restoration is complete.","text_backup_restore_notice":"Avoid working on website during restoration!","text_backupHeaderSubtitle":"We store incremental backups created in the past 30 days, including files and database.","text_backupHeaderAction":"Create Backup","text_limitAddSection":"Maximum of {{count}} sections allowed.<br/> To add a new section, delete<br/> an existing one.","text_limitAddPage":"Maximum of {{count}} pages allowed.<br/> To add a new page, delete<br/> an existing one.","text_builderV2CreateCompanyInfoText":"\u201cMediaGo is a startup that provides a mobile app for instant<br/> access to news and entertainment. The app is designed to be<br/> easy to navigate and streamlined for quick use.\u201d","text_builderV2CreateCompanyInfoText1":"\u201cOur cozy family restaurant serves delicious home-style Italian meals, accompanied by warm hospitality, creating the perfect<br/> atmosphere for enjoying quality time with loved ones.\u201d","text_builderV2CreateCompanyInfoText2":"\u201cOur tech blog covering the latest trends, innovations, and gadgets,<br/> offering expert insights and analysis to keep readers informed<br/> on the evolving tech landscape.\u201d","text_builderV2CreateCompanyInfoText3":"\u201cAs a full stack developer with over 5 years of experience in web<br/> development, I specialize in creating responsive, user-friendly<br/> websites and stay passionate about exploring new web technologies.\u201d","text_builderV2CreateCompanyInfoText4":"\u201cAn online music school providing an extensive selection of courses,<br/> live interactive lessons, and personalized instruction from expert<br/> musicians, designed to cater to learners of all skill levels and musical interests.\u201d","text_builderV2EcommerceText1":"\u201cWe sell handmade items, from artisan jewelry to unique home decor, each crafted with care and creativity.\u201d","text_builderV2EcommerceText2":"\u201cWe provide products for pets, including comfortable beds, nutritious food, and engaging toys to support pet wellness.\u201d","text_builderV2EcommerceText3":"\u201cWe offer tech essentials like laptops, smart devices, and accessories, all designed for everyday functionality and innovation.\u201d","text_builderV2EcommerceText4":"\u201cWe sell wellness products, including skincare and aromatherapy items, to promote relaxation and self-care.\u201d","text_onboardingFirstStep":"Answer a few questions and our AI will generate a personalized website<br/>with tailored content and images.\u201d","text_emailCampaignTitle":"Starting Fresh<br/>with AI Builder 2.0","text_emailCampaignDesc":"<div class=\'mb20\'>To experience the new AI Builder 2.0, we\u2019ll need to erase your<br/> current generated website and start the flow from scratch.</div>Ready to build your website with our enhanced,<br/> fully customizable AI-Powered Builder?","text_emailCampaignButton":"Yes, Start Fresh!","text_websiteZoneIsBeingCreated":"This may take a few moments while your new server</br> is being set up on Google Cloud.","text_websiteZoneIsFailed":"An issue occurred during the setup of your Virtual<br/> Private Server. Please reach out to our<br/> <a class=\'customer-care-link\'>Customer Care Team</a> for assistance.","text_extendWithCouponHeader":"Get 1 month of 10Web Pro plans for Free and 50% off on your first payment","text_campaignHeaderResurrection":"Try 10Web Pro free for {{couponDays}} + {{couponPercent}}% off","text_campaignHeaderResurrectionDays":"Try 10Web Pro free for {{couponDays}}","text_extendHeader":"Get 1 month of 10Web Pro plans for Free","text_blkOfferTwentyFour":"Upgrade Now & Sav